================================================================================
Provenance
================================================================================

This plugin combines code from LeGoTDP, LeGo Vibe Control,
LeGo2BrightnessFix and WiFi Optimizer Go 2 by Rayekkk. The WiFi module is based
on Arcada Labs' WiFi Optimizer under the same BSD-3-Clause terms. LeGo Vibe
Control began as Ally Vibe Control by
piyush-tyagi-13 (https://github.com/piyush-tyagi-13/ally-vibe-control, MIT), and
M4ttiA contributed its original per-game profiles. Inherited code remains under
the MIT notice distributed in LICENSE.MIT.

The RGB module's interface design and Legion Go 2 sysfs implementation were
informed by HueSync 3.9.0 by honjow and Steam Deck Homebrew
(https://github.com/honjow/HueSync, BSD-3-Clause). Its notice and license are
distributed in LICENSE.HUESYNC. The power-button register mapping itself was
re-audited against the target Go 2's RRCN16WW ACPI DSDT and is intentionally
different from HueSync's older Go 2 mapping.

